1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,500
Welcome to AUDRYN — the evidence-first multi-agent financial audit intelligence system.

2
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:13,500
In modern statutory auditing, conclusions cannot precede evidence.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:20,500
Black-box language models frequently hallucinate figures, invent references, and fail statutory rigor.

4
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,500
AUDRYN re-architects financial auditing from first principles: every claim is anchored to immutable evidence.

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:32,000
All arithmetic is strictly computed by deterministic Python Decimal engines.

6
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:38,500
Multi-agent investigations operate under adversarial review with full human partner sign-off.

7
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:44,500
Audits begin in the Evidence Vault. In Workspace 1 and 2, every workpaper is ingested.

8
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,500
Each file is stamped with an immutable SHA-256 cryptographic digest.

9
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:57,000
The Completeness Gate enforces that no investigation begins until required schedules are verified.

10
00:00:57,500 --> 00:01:03,500
If an evidence file is altered by even a single byte, AUDRYN detects the mismatch instantly.

11
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:10,000
In Workspace 3 and 4, specialized multi-agent teams investigate the general ledger.

12
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:17,000
Tax Specialists, Forensic Investigators, and Evidence Matchers cross-reference entries against statutory criteria.

13
00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:23,500
Notice: agents do not calculate numbers. All arithmetic is delegated to Python's Decimal engine.

14
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:30,500
The GAP RADAR visualizes reconciliation gaps, highlighting Section 40A(3) cash disallowances.

15
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:37,500
This is AUDRYN's core architectural distinction: the Counter-Evidence Engine.

16
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:44,500
While conventional AI prematurely labels anomalies as fraud, AUDRYN deploys adversarial review.

17
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:51,500
For each anomaly, the challenger searches for mitigating evidence — such as board approvals or reversals.

18
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:58,000
In Workspace 6, final audit authority remains exclusively human under ICAI standards.

19
00:01:58,500 --> 00:02:05,000
Only an authorized signing partner can sign off, with mandatory acknowledgment of unresolved points.

20
00:02:05,500 --> 00:02:11,500
In Workspace 7, the Indian Tax Rulebook calculates Section 115BAA corporate liabilities at 25.168%.

21
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:18,000
In Workspace 8, board-ready audit reports are compiled with a strict Not-Checked Register.

22
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:25,500
In Workspace 9, our 3D Provenance Graph visualizes the complete chain of custody.

23
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:32,000
Finally, Workspace 10 demonstrates production-grade AI resilience.

24
00:02:32,500 --> 00:02:39,500
AUDRYN orchestrates four inference tiers: local private Ollama, Google Gemini 2.0 Flash, Groq, and NVIDIA NIM.

25
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:46,000
If a provider experiences rate limits, the circuit breaker automatically fails over with zero session loss.

26
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:53,000
Data governance guards ensure confidential client data is never transmitted to cloud providers.

27
00:02:53,500 --> 00:03:00,000
AUDRYN delivers multi-agent intelligence anchored by deterministic proof.

28
00:03:00,500 --> 00:03:07,000
269 automated tests, role-based access control, and zero floating-point errors.

29
00:03:07,500 --> 00:03:13,000
AUDRYN: Evidence before conclusions.
